OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage sites at 'heart of
OL,4,Acommunities' share #41m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 74 heritage sites across
OL,7,FEngland will receive a share of #41m
OL,8,Ffor repairs and renovations, the
OL,9,Fgovernment has announced.
OL,11,FChurches, synagogues, town halls and
OL,12,Fother historic buildings at the "heart
OL,13,Fof our communities" and in areas most
OL,14,Fin need are set to benefit from two
OL,15,Ffunding schemes.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
