OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1792045548
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage sites at 'heart of
OL,4,Acommunities' share #41m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey include St Mary de Castro in
OL,7,FLeicester, St Stephen's Church in
OL,8,FNottingham, Birmingham Cathedral, Dover
OL,9,FCastle, Margate Museum and Old Town
OL,10,FHall in Kent, and Osborne, Queen
OL,11,FVictoria's family residence on the Isle
OL,12,Fof Wight.
OL,14,FHeritage minister Baroness Twycross, of
OL,15,Fthe Department for Digital, Culture,
OL,16,FMedia and Sport, said the funding would
OL,17,Fallow "much loved buildings" to remain
OL,18,Fopen in the future.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
